    "title": "CURIEL SS27: WHAT HAPPENS BETWEEN THE BODY AND THE DRESS? - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Luca Imbimbo ,\n21 hours ago Veils Between does not ask to be looked at. It asks to be felt. And in a fashion system increasingly obsessed with visibility, perhaps that is already a statement. Presented in Milan on September 22 at CURIEL’s historic Via Montenapoleone address, the Spring Summer 2027 collection moves into the space between skin and garment: the lining beneath the fabric, the shadow created by a pleat, the glimpse of embroidery caught only when the body moves. Read full article",
